 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION: Catalyzes the decarboxylation of L-aspartate, 3-sulfino-L-alanine (cysteine sulfinic acid), and L-cysteate to beta-alanine, hypotaurine and taurine, respectively. The preferredsubstrate is 3-sulfino-L-alanine. Does not exhibit anydecarboxylation activity toward glutamate.{ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:Q9DBE0}.CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=H(+) + L-aspartate = beta-alanine + CO2;Xref=Rhea:RHEA:19497, ChEBI:CHEBI:15378, ChEBI:CHEBI:16526,ChEBI:CHEBI:29991, ChEBI:CHEBI:57966; EC=4.1.1.11;Evidence={ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:Q9DBE0};CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=3-sulfino-L-alanine + H(+) = CO2 + hypotaurine;Xref=Rhea:RHEA:16877, ChEBI:CHEBI:15378, ChEBI:CHEBI:16526,ChEBI:CHEBI:57853, ChEBI:CHEBI:61085; EC=4.1.1.29;Evidence={ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:Q9DBE0};CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=H(+) + L-cysteate = CO2 + taurine; Xref=Rhea:RHEA:25221,ChEBI:CHEBI:15378, ChEBI:CHEBI:16526, ChEBI:CHEBI:58090,ChEBI:CHEBI:507393; EC=4.1.1.29;Evidence={ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:Q9DBE0};COFACTOR:Name=pyridoxal 5&apos;-phosphate; Xref=ChEBI:CHEBI:597326;Evidence={ECO:0000269|Ref.6};PATHWAY: Organosulfur biosynthesis; taurine biosynthesis;hypotaurine from L-cysteine: step 2/2.SUBUNIT: Homodimer. {ECO:0000269|Ref.6}.ALTERNATIVE PRODUCTS:Event=Alternative splicing; Named isoforms=3;Name=1; Synonyms=Long;IsoId=Q9Y600-1; Sequence=Displayed;Name=2; Synonyms=Short;IsoId=Q9Y600-2; Sequence=VSP_001307;Name=3;IsoId=Q9Y600-3; Sequence=VSP_039002;Note=No experimental confirmation available. Ref.4 (AAH98342)sequence is in conflict in position: 9:F-&gt;S. {ECO:0000305};TISSUE SPECIFICITY: Expressed in liver and brain. Also expressedin both astrocytes and neurons, but lower levels are expressed inastrocytes. {ECO:0000269|PubMed:26327310}.SIMILARITY: Belongs to the group II decarboxylase family.{ECO:0000305}.SEQUENCE CAUTION:Sequence=AAD32546.1; Type=Erroneous initiation; Note=Translation N-terminally extended.; Evidence={ECO:0000305};Sequence=AAH98278.1; Type=Erroneous initiation; Note=Translation N-terminally extended.; Evidence={ECO:0000305};Sequence=AAH98342.1; Type=Erroneous initiation; Note=Translation N-terminally extended.; Evidence={ECO:0000305};Sequence=AAH99717.1; Type=Erroneous initiation; Note=Translation N-terminally extended.; Evidence={ECO:0000305};Sequence=AAI05919.1; Type=Erroneous initiation; Note=Translation N-terminally extended.; Evidence={ECO:0000305}; COPYRIGHT: UniProt Consortium (www.uniprot.org). Distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivs License.</bp:comment>
