 <bp:displayName rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FABD_HUMAN</bp:displayName>
 <bp:name rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2.3.1.39</bp:name>
 <bp:name rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Mitochondrial malonyl CoA:ACP acyltransferase</bp:name>
 <bp:name rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">MT</bp:name>
 <bp:name rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Mitochondrial malonyltransferase</bp:name>
 <bp:name rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">MCAT</bp:name>
 <bp:name rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">[Acyl-carrier-protein] malonyltransferase</bp:name>
 <bp:name rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">MCT</bp:name>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">FUNCTION: Catalyzes the transfer of a malonyl moiety from malonyl-CoA to the free thiol group of the phosphopantetheine arm of themitochondrial ACP protein (NDUFAB1). This suggests the existenceof the biosynthesis of fatty acids in mitochondria.{ECO:0000269|PubMed:12882974}.CATALYTIC ACTIVITY:Reaction=holo-[ACP] + malonyl-CoA = CoA + malonyl-[ACP];Xref=Rhea:RHEA:41792, Rhea:RHEA-COMP:9623, Rhea:RHEA-COMP:9685,ChEBI:CHEBI:57287, ChEBI:CHEBI:57384, ChEBI:CHEBI:64479,ChEBI:CHEBI:78449; EC=2.3.1.39;Evidence={ECO:0000269|PubMed:12882974};PATHWAY: Lipid metabolism; fatty acid biosynthesis.SUBCELLULAR LOCATION: Mitochondrion {ECO:0000269|PubMed:12882974}.ALTERNATIVE PRODUCTS:Event=Alternative splicing; Named isoforms=2;Name=1;IsoId=Q8IVS2-1; Sequence=Displayed;Name=2;IsoId=Q8IVS2-2; Sequence=VSP_010517, VSP_010518;SIMILARITY: Belongs to the type II malonyltransferase family.{ECO:0000305}. COPYRIGHT: UniProt Consortium (www.uniprot.org). Distributed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivs License.</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ProteinReference_uniprotkb_Q8IVS2_identity</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://identifiers.org/uniprot/B0QY72</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">REPLACED http://pathwaycommons.org/pc12/ProteinReference_HPRD_14786_identity</bp:comment>
